$ a SOL 144 divergence analysis: the guide's static divergence speed is
$ 1419.9 ft/s (Bisplinghoff, Ashley and Halfman), its K-method 1419.8 ft/s
$ at k 0.0001 (Simcenter 2606's guide, p. 7-64); at RHOREF 1.1468-7
$ lb-s2/in4 that is q = 16.646 psi.
$ CMETHOD / EIGC for Simcenter's complex eigensolver (nastran95ase reads
$ and does not use them). Simcenter Nastran 2606: q = 16.64156 psi
$ (data/ha145c_diverg_simcenter2606.f06).
